              text: 'Qumu ya bani en-nour, li-nusabbih Rabb el-quwwat.\n\n+ Likay yun\'im lana bi-khalas nufusina.\n\n\'Indama naqif amamak gasadiyyan.\n\n+ Inza\' \'an \'uqulina nawm el-ghafla.\n\nA\'tina ya Rabb yaqaza, likay nafham an naqif amamak waqt es-salah.\n\n+ Wa nursil lak ila fawq et-tamgeed el-la\'iq, wa nafuz bi-ghufran khatayana el-katheera. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\nHa barikoo er-Rabb ya \'abeed er-Rabb. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\n+ El-qa\'imeen fi bayt er-Rabb, fi diyar bayt ilahina. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\nBil-layali irfa\'u aydiyakum ila fawq ayyuha el-qiddiseen barikoo er-Rabb. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\n+ Yubarikuka er-Rabb min Sahyoun, alladhi khalaqa es-sama\' wal-ard. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\nFaltadnu waseelati quddamak ya Rabb, ka-qawlika fahhimni. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\n+ Liyadkhul ibtihali amamak, ka-kalimatika ahyini. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\nTafeed shafatay es-subh, idha ma \'allamtani huquqak. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\n+ Lisani yugeeb bi-aqwalik li-anna gamee\' wasayak hiya haqq. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\nLitakun yaduka li-tukhallisani li-anni ishtahaytu wasayak. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\n+ Ishtaqtu ila khalasika ya Rabb, wa namousuka huwa tilawati. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\nTahya nafsi wa tusabbihuk, wa ahkamuka tu\'eenuni. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\n+ Dalaltu mithl el-kharouf ed-dall, fa-utlub \'abdak li-anni li-wasayak lam ansa. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\nEl-magd lil-Ab wal-Ibn war-Rooh el-Qudus. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\n+ El-an wa kulla awan wa ila dahr ed-duhour, ameen. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\nEl-magd lil-Ab wal-Ibn war-Rooh el-Qudus mundhu el-an wa ila abad el-abideen kulliha, ameen. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\n+ El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar es-saleh, el-magd li-ummika el-\'adhra\' wa gamee\' qiddiseek. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\nEl-magd lak ayyuha el-waheed, ayyuha eth-thalouth el-quddous irhamna. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\n+ Liyaqum Allah wa litatabaddad gamee\' a\'da\'ih, wa liyahrub min quddam waghihi kullu mubghidi ismihi el-quddous. El-magd lak ya muhibb el-bashar.\n\nWa amma sha\'buka falyakun bil-baraka, ulouf ulouf wa rabawat rabawat, yasna\'oon iradatak.\n\n+ Ya Rabb iftah shafatayya wa liyantiq fami bi-tasbihatik.',
